# Optional. Copy to .env, fill in, `direnv allow`. The dotenv role also exports every
# variable set here into ~/.bashrc (above the interactive guard), so `ssh host 'bash -lc
# cmd'`, git hooks and cron see them too. Edit this file and re-run the playbook; never
# hand-edit the managed block in ~/.bashrc.
#
# GITHUB_TOKEN and TYPESAFE_API_KEY are NOT here on Frank's hosts: gh-token-fleet and
# jev-fleet own them and write them into ~/.bashrc themselves. The github and typesafe
# roles read both from the environment, so a host without those tools can still set
# TYPESAFE_API_KEY below and the dotenv role exports it the same way.

# Lets the tailscale role run `tailscale up` unattended. A Reusable key from
# https://login.tailscale.com/admin/settings/keys
TAILSCALE_AUTH_KEY=tskey-auth-xxxxx

# Optional. Lets the tailscale role disable node-key expiry for this machine through the
# REST API. An OAuth client with the `devices:core` write scope, from
# https://login.tailscale.com/admin/settings/trust-credentials. Set both or neither.
#TAILSCALE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=kxxxxxxxxCNTRL
#TAILSCALE_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET=tskey-client-xxxxx

# Optional. The TypeSafe API key (https://console.typesafe.ai/keys) the typesafe role
# writes into ~/.claude/settings.json for the fast-jev-compaction and claude-jev plugins.
#TYPESAFE_API_KEY=apikey_xxxxx
